{#- Sent to each camper about a week before camp: their stay, meals, lodging, parking and arrival,
    then reminders for everyone. Converted from lark-camp-admin-tool's Blade template (#8).
    Yearly edits are in the event's template vars (regTemplateVars.ts). -#}
{%- set attrs = camper.attributes -%}
{%- set admin = camper.admin_attributes -%}
{#- Only a lodging in a camp counts: a camper who chose "Let registrar assign my lodging" or
    "Off Site" has that as their lodging until the registrar places them -#}
{%- set path = camper.lodging.path_names if camper.lodging else [] -%}
{%- set path = path if path and path[0].startswith('Camp ') else [] -%}
{#- The lodging without its spot, e.g. Camp 1 → Tent → Area A -#}
{%- set lodging_names = [] -%}
{%- for name in path if not name.startswith('Spot ') -%}
  {%- do lodging_names.append(name) -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- set lodging = lodging_names | join(' → ') -%}
{%- set camp = path[0] if path else '' -%}
{#- Camp 3 eats in Camp 2 -#}
{%- set meal_camp = 'Camp 2' if camp == 'Camp 3' else camp -%}
{%- set reg_type = (registration.registration_type.name if registration.registration_type else '') | lower -%}
{%- set meal_plan = ((attrs.meals or {}).meal_plan or '') -%}
{%- set has_meals = meal_plan and 'no meal' not in (meal_plan | lower) -%}
{%- set has_breakfast = has_meals and 'just dinner' not in (meal_plan | lower) -%}
{%- set vars = event.template_vars -%}
{#- The first day of the camper's session: the event's second day (a Friday) for full camp and the
    first half, its sixth (a Tuesday) for the second half, as regTemplateVars.ts has them -#}
{%- if event.days | length > 5 -%}
  {%- set arrives = event.days[5] if attrs.session == 'Half camp - 2nd half' else event.days[1] -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- set arrives = none -%}
{%- endif -%}
{#- Where the camper eats: the registrar's assignment, else their camp's kitchen; anything but a camp
    is unassigned -#}
{%- set breakfast_in = admin.meal_assignment_breakfast or meal_camp or '' -%}
{%- set dinners_in = admin.meal_assignment_dinner or meal_camp or '' -%}
Dear {{ attrs.first_name or 'Camper' }},

We're just a week away from Lark Camp and we're very excited! You may be receiving this email on behalf of another camper, and if so, please forward or share this email with the intended recipient.

We are looking forward to seeing you soon! This year you won't be receiving anything from Lark Camp via post. You do not need to fill out anything ahead of time or bring paper forms with you. All the information you need is in this email.

Please read the following information carefully, and let us know that everything looks correct to you. If you see something that looks amiss, please email [registration@larkcamp.org](mailto:registration@larkcamp.org) with the subject "request for registration change" and we will do our best to accommodate you.

[Visit this document for detailed general information about camp](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Vx2x29oKLjBtANDZKu9keJbHf61FxXnY-xjkISEZw2k/edit)

You will need to present a picture of a negative COVID test taken within 48 hours when you arrive at camp. Please save this picture on your phone so that we can verify this before you enter camp. Do NOT email in the photo.

If you have a balance due, you should have received an email from PayPal asking to pay it. If you believe your balance is not correct, or you did not receive that email, please contact the registrar at [registration@larkcamp.org](mailto:registration@larkcamp.org)

{% if admin.guardian_forms_required and not admin.guardian_forms_received -%}
**WE HAVE NOT RECEIVED YOUR GUARDIAN FORMS!**

If we do not receive your guardian forms filled out and returned to LTA by a parent or legal guardian by {{ vars.guardian_forms_due_date }} you cannot come to camp.

[Guardian Form](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P-JNJkSOpWKzUqGvo61IaqsKNSuzruLmt3o6t6Jchz8/edit?usp=sharing)

{% endif -%}
**Stay:** {{ attrs.session or '' }}

**Meal Plan:** {{ meal_plan or 'No meal plan' }}

**Lodging Location:** {{ lodging or 'To be assigned' }}

{% if has_breakfast -%}
**Breakfast in:** {{ breakfast_in if breakfast_in.startswith('Camp') else 'Unassigned' }}

{% endif -%}
{% if has_meals -%}
**Dinners in:** {{ dinners_in if dinners_in.startswith('Camp') else 'Unassigned' }}

{% endif -%}
{% if camp == 'Camp 1' and 'Area A' in lodging_names -%}
### IMPORTANT - MEDICAL AIR EVACUATION INFO FOR THE MEADOW

In the unlikely event that a medical air evacuation is needed, Tent Area A (aka The Meadow in Camp 1) is the designated emergency helicopter landing area at the Mendocino Woodlands.

* Only unstaked tents with lightweight frames are allowed in Area A.
* No metal popup canopies or metal frame tents or structures are allowed.

If Lark Camp is notified to clear the meadow for emergency helicopter landing, all available campers will pull all the tents and contents within 15 minutes to the side of the meadow. After the air evacuation is complete, the tent's owner sets their own tent back up. By camping in Area A, you accept the risk of possible damage to your property in the event of an emergency, and will not hold Lark Camp, the Mendocino Woodlands Camp Association, Emergency Responders, or Good Samaritans responsible.

{% endif -%}
{% if camp == 'Camp 2' -%}
Please do not plug into RV shore power unless you require a CPAP medical device. Running power to your campsite is not allowed unless you're in a designated CPAP cabin. Using microwaves, fridges, or any high-power device is not allowed. The last few camps have caused the camp 2 breakers to trip daily, and if this keeps happening we'll have to ban use of electrical outlets completely. Please also note that you may not use RV generators inside of camp.

{% endif -%}
